### Netcup SCP API — Metrics
# Server performance metrics. Up to 1440 hours of historical data.

### CPU Metrics
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/cpu
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### CPU Metrics (last 24 hours)
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/cpu?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Disk Metrics
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/disk
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Disk Metrics (last 24 hours)
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/disk?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Network Traffic Metrics
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/network
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Network Traffic Metrics (last 24 hours)
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/network?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Network Packet Metrics
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/network/packet
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Network Packet Metrics (last 24 hours)
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/network/packet?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
